      'The Municipal Securities Rulemaking Board (MSRB) was established to create rules and regulations covering broker-dealers, underwriters, investment advisers, and their reps who deal in municipal securities. It also creates exams for municipal securities representatives, advisers, and principal supervisors. Many MSRB rules are similar to FINRA rules.\n\nThis section will focus on areas that are specific to the MSRB.',
